'''Pied Piper Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]] who can be unlocked when beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Aku's Melody (Merciless)|Temptation's Symphony]] appearing on the '''9th''', '''10th''', '''23rd''', and '''24th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] increases health, speed and [[Shield Piercing]] chance, and grants a [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Wave]].

