==Trivia==
*Pied Piper Cat is based on the story of the [[wikipedia:Pied Piper of Hamelin|Pied Piper of Hamelin]]. His drop stage being found under [[Aku's Melody (Merciless)|Temptation's Symphony]] may reference how the Pied Piper's music "tempts" others to follow him.
*[[wikipedia:Komusō|Komusō]] ("monks of emptiness") were traveling, ''[[wikipedia:Shakuhachi|shakuhachi]]''-playing Buddhists distinguished by the straw baskets they wore on their heads.
*Brass Cat could be partially inspired by the [[Unimplemented Features/Mobile#Drumcorps Cat|unused sousaphone-playing Cat]] in [[Drumcorps Cat (Rare Cat)|Drumcorps Cat]]'s spritesheet.

